# Market-data credentials for the EQUITY SHADOW observer.
#
# Install to /etc/autotrader/autotrader-shadow.secrets.env, 0640 root:atshadow.
# SHIPS EMPTY. Never commit a value into this file.
#
# The broker issues one key pair for both data and trading, so these are not
# read-only credentials at the broker even though the only thing this process
# does with them is fetch bars and read the market calendar. That is precisely
# why the guarantee is structural rather than credential-scoped: the shadow
# runtime imports nothing from the execution layer, its constructor has no
# gateway seam, and tests assert both against the parsed source. See
# autotrader-equity-shadow.service for the four independent layers.
#
# The dashboard API is given NO credential at all - it opens a SQLite file.
ALPACA_API_KEY=
ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=
